he known gap\"\n-    (is (= (str \"PHP Fatal error:  Uncaught Error: string offset writes are not \"\n-                \"supported yet (yang.php known gap G-str-offset-write)\")\n-           (run '(php/path-assign \"abc\" [0] \"x\")))))\n+  (testing \"a single-byte string write assigns through (G-str-offset-write closed in 91c5c8cd)\"\n+    (is (= \"xbc\" (run '(php/echo (php/path-assign \"abc\" [0] \"x\"))))))\n   (testing \"copy on write: the original is unchanged\"\n     (is (= \"1,2\"\n            (run '(let [a (php/array-append (php/empty-array) 1)\nc0e2f8d4 feat(dao.stream.ble): BLE radio transport and flooding mesh — raw layer, link machine, dart seam\nd01a7c80 docs(ledger): the Linux datagram refusals-and-lifecycle rows close (a226423d) and dedupe 4 rows to 1\nc02c7c5f docs(agents): restore the dao.stream merge precondition dropped by the dedup pass\n7eaf30fd fix(ledger): deduplicate the merge's accidental row duplication (127 -> unique)\n7995ce4b test(yang.php): p4 pin folds :out :diag :uncaught like p3b; recorded-vs-pinned cross-check; banner/enabled? dedupe; fold pass-10 records\n1d29cdcf feat(dao.space.query): add the datomic client-api q adapter boundary (phase 1)\n4c4764f7 feat(yin.vm.ucf): the fenced writer -- assign, send, retain, discharge (linker M-next D11)\n0c7ee4ee docs(design): publish the UCF version-1 amendment for fenced custody (linker hardening M-next B)\nbe1f8d06 feat(yang.python): ruling-6 numeric dict and set keys, one shared NaN key, delete data/numeric-key\ncb96de0b feat(yin.vm): linker authority policy, slices A1 and A2\n92103d8b Wire portable numeric operations into dao.space (step 3)\n6f082654 docs(design): accept the returned-result-set merge as a known limit\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
